    <h1>Etsy Privacy Policy Generator</h1>
    <p class="last-updated">Updated November 25, 2026</p>

    <p>An Etsy privacy policy generator turns a few answers about your shop into a privacy policy you can paste into the Privacy tab of your Etsy shop policies. Etsy does offer a basic sample privacy policy inside Shop Manager, but it is a one-size-fits-all starting point: it does not know which shipping tools, email platform, print-on-demand partner or bookkeeping app handles your buyers' data. Etsy requires a privacy policy if you are based in the EU or sell to buyers there, and recommends one for every seller. A <a href="https://buildprivacypolicy.com/">free generator that builds the policy from your own answers</a> lets you produce one that names your actual tools, then paste it into Shop Manager, host it free at its own URL, or download it, with no signup or payment.</p>

    <p>This guide covers when Etsy requires a seller privacy policy, exactly what buyer data Etsy hands you, Etsy's own rules on what you may do with that data, what the policy must include (including Etsy Payments, Etsy Ads and Offsite Ads), the extra obligations for EU and UK sellers, where the policy goes in Shop Manager, how Etsy's sample policy compares with a generated one, and a ready-to-copy sample.</p>

